---
// Privacy policy - plain-language, covers this website only.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = 'November 4, 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Mission CTRL handles the information you share through missionctrl.team.">
  <section class="sky sky-page">
    <div class="stars far"></div>
    <div class="stars"></div>
    <Header />
    <div class="container page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</p>
      <h1 class="serif display">Your information, <em>handled with care.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main id="main" class="container section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information Mission CTRL collects through this website,
        missionctrl.team, and what we do with it. The short version: we only collect what you choose
        to send us, we use it only to reply to you, and we never sell it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill out our contact form, we receive the information you enter:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name and email address</li>
        <li>Your phone number and organization, if you provide them</li>
        <li>The service you're interested in and your message</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If you email or call us directly, we receive whatever you include in that email or call.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information only to respond to you and to discuss or carry out work you've asked us
        about. We don't add you to a mailing list unless you ask us to, and we don't sell, rent or trade
        your information.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use advertising, tracking cookies or analytics that follow you around the web.
      </p>

      <h2>Services we rely on</h2>
      <p>A few trusted providers help run this site, and they may process limited technical information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the website and delivers contact form messages to our inbox.
          Like any web host, it handles standard request information such as your IP address and browser type.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> checks that contact form messages come from a person rather than a
          spam bot. It looks at technical signals from your browser to do this, and is not used for advertising.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Fonts</strong> supplies the typefaces on this site, so your browser connects to
          Google's servers to download them.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep messages only as long as needed to respond and, if we work together, for the length of
        that relationship and any record-keeping it requires.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us at any time to see, correct or delete the information you've sent us. Email
        <a href="mailto:help@missionctrl.team">help@missionctrl.team</a> and we'll take care of it.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for organizations and adults. We don't knowingly collect information
        from children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Our apps</h2>
      <p>
        This policy covers missionctrl.team only. Apps we build, such as the Jesus Christ App and Berean,
        have their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy, we'll update the date at the top of this page. Questions? Contact
        Mission CTRL at <a href="mailto:help@missionctrl.team">help@missionctrl.team</a>,
        <a href="tel:+17435298247">(743) 529-8247</a>, or 2797 Windy Ridge Rd, North Wilkesboro, NC 28659.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
